    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f1a0c5696bd9a879fc4930</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 12:49:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春节过后一回上海，小赵小李和小陈一碰面就发现我们都哭了😭。一段时间茶余饭后的热聊话题总是 “你是怎么被父母整破防的”。想要的情绪价值很多，但往往我们和父母的交流总能完美回避所有的美好表达。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这也许是一生都要慢慢学习的功课吧，至少分享彼此的故事，是治愈的开始😊</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>三女一男，四枚魔都打工人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小赵 - @树上的猪</span></p><span></span><p><span>小李 - @淞虹路李李</span></p><span></span><p><span>小陈 - @葩主</span></p><span></span><p><span>小张 - @transev</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">1:41</a> </span></strong><span>听听姑娘们的春节破防故事吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 男生和女生果然不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a> 父母这些年也长进了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">35:32</a> 换位思考一下 你想要什么样的回答</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Boogie Woogie Man</span></p>]]></description>
