    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c5abe13af97665afc317f3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Feb 2024 04:36:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在节奏超快的魔都，相亲是打工人找到另一半的重要途径。怎么处理内耗？怎么找到高效的省钱相亲方式？欢迎来听我们唠唠~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>三女一男，四枚魔都打工人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小赵 - @树上的猪</span></p><span></span><p><span>小李 - @淞虹路李李</span></p><span></span><p><span>小陈 - @葩主</span></p><span></span><p><span>小张 - @transev</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容提要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 为什么女生相亲会有更多内耗？减少内耗的小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 相亲对象的来源（App, 亲友介绍和群面）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 相亲的时候你比较看重什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">29:12</a> 相亲的时候该聊什么，不该聊什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>相亲怎么发拒信？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3028">50:28</a> 相亲的省钱方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3574">59:34</a> 相亲久了还会有 ”咯噔“的感觉吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4477">74:37</a> 相亲App推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4739">78:59</a> 超精华版总结</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Boogie Woogie Man</span></p>]]></description>
